  s0: No owner row, the gateway serves (no node set)
  s1: No owner row, the gateway serves (no node set, the hub's file says otherwise, 1 file edit so far)
  s2: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far)
  s3: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far), an input waits at the gateway
  s4: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far), an input is kept for the designated node
  s5: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far), an input is handed to the designated node
  s6: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far), the designated node's worker claimed an input that has not begun
