  s11: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far, designated node down), an input waits at the gateway, idle session on the designated node, the designated node keeps a session the user cleared
  s12: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far), an input waits at the gateway, idle session on the designated node, the designated node keeps a session the user cleared
