  s16: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far), turn runs on the designated node [a cleared input ran]
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an operator edits one node's config file
  s1 --> s2: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s2 --> s3: you send a message
  s3 --> s4: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s4 --> s5: the input is handed to the node that owns the channel
  s5 --> s5: a node reads the owner row again
  s5 --> s6: the home's worker claims the input
  s6 --> s7: the input begins in a session of the current generation
  s7 --> s8: the answer reaches Discord
  s8 --> s9: the designated node stops
  s9 --> s10: you send a message
  s10 --> s11: you run /clear at the gateway
  s11 --> s12: the designated node boots and ends its session of an older owner
  s12 --> s13: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s13 --> s14: the input is handed to the node that owns the channel
  s14 --> s15: the home's worker claims the input
  s15 --> s16: the input begins in a session of the current generation
